<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves fall to 71.81 bln ringgit.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves fall to 71.81 bln ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves fell to 71.81 billion ringgit as at April 15 against 72.19 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
